Hi <%= @name %>,

we have your report. To have it acted on, please confirm this email address:

<%= @confirm_url %>

Until you do, the case sits untouched with our admins and nothing about the
reported content changes.

  Reported:     <%= @content_label %>
  Address:      <%= @content_url %>
  Reported as:  <%= @category_label %>

If you did not send this report, simply ignore this email. Nothing happens
without the confirmation.

<%= render "_signature_en.text" %>

<%= render "_footer.text" %>
